  _boundGraphSerialization: '{"type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DialogueTree","nodes":[{"_action":{"executionMode":0,"actions":[{"HoldAfterBgVisibleSeconds":{"_value":0.5},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.Node.WaitVillageStartBgRevealActionTask"},{"canvasGroup":{"_name":"YaerPainting","_targetVariableID":"7c3e9a21-4b8f-4d2a-9e1c-0f5a6b7c8d9e"},"StartAlpha":{},"EndAlpha":{"_value":1.0},"Duration":{"_value":0.5},"Delay":{},"EndActionOnAnimationEnd":{"_value":true},"$type":"CanvasGroupAlphaActionTask"},{"StartAlpha":{},"EndAlpha":{"_value":1.0},"Duration":{"_value":0.5},"Delay":{"_value":0.5},"EndActonOnAnimationEnd":{"_value":true},"PrepareMaskAvatarOnFadeIn":{"_value":true},"MaskAvatarRole":{"_value":1},"MaskAvatarFace":{"_value":1},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.Node.NormalDialogueUIAlphaAnimationTaskAction"}],"$type":"NodeCanvas.Framework.ActionList"},"_position":{"x":749.0,"y":-21.0},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ActionNode","$id":"0"},{"FaceType":{"_value":1},"statement":{"_text":"\u554a\u554a\u3002\u3002\u867d\u7136\u6211\u4ee5\u524d\u5c31\u60f3\u8bf4\u4e86\uff0c\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u8981\u5728\u62d0\u5f2f\u5904\u653e\u4e00\u4e2a\u8fd9\u4e48\u788d\u4e8b\u7684\u4e1c\u897f\u554a\u3002","_text_en":"Ugh...
    I''ve been meaning to say this for a while\u2014why would anyone put something
    so annoying right at a corner?","_text_jp":"\u3042\u3042\u3042\u2026\u2026\u524d\u304b\u3089\u8a00\u3044\u305f\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3051\u3069\u3001\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3053\u3093\u306a\u90aa\u9b54\u306a\u3082\u306e\u3092\u66f2\u304c\u308a\u89d2\u306b\u7f6e\u304f\u306e\u3088\u3002","_audio":1},"_actorName":"\u96c5\u5c14","_actorParameterID":"49ab5f08-7fb3-49c8-8220-eacfb9100946","_position":{"x":663.4915,"y":182.6658},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"1"},{"_action":{"parameter":{"_value":"KingMove"},"parameterHashID":{},"$type":"NodeCanvas.Tasks.Actions.MecanimSetTrigger"},"_position":{"x":1137.0,"y":290.0},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ActionNode","$id":"2"},{"FaceType":{"_value":2},"statement":{"_text":"\u55ef!\u8fd9\u662f\u8c01\u5f04\u7684!","_text_en":"Huh?!
    Who did this?!","_text_jp":"\u3046\u3080\uff01\u3053\u308c\u306f\u8ab0\u304c\u3084\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\uff01"},"_actorName":"\u738b","_actorParameterID":"38ea5d2c-aaf2-4e22-8e12-25bd6113fad4","_position":{"x":786.3142,"y":309.4887},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"3"},{"FaceType":{"_value":3},"statement":{"_text":"\u5f53\u7136\u662f\u4f60\u8d85\u7ea7\u65e0\u654c\u53ef\u7231\u7684\u5973\u513f\u5927\u4eba\u4e86
    !","_text_en":"Who else but your super ultra cute daughter, of course!","_text_jp":"\u3082\u3061\u308d\u3093\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30a6\u30eb\u30c8\u30e9\u304b\u308f\u3044\u3044\u5a18\u69d8\u306e\u79c1\u3067\u3059\u3088\uff01","_audio":2},"_actorName":"\u96c5\u5c14","_actorParameterID":"49ab5f08-7fb3-49c8-8220-eacfb9100946","_position":{"x":729.3144,"y":392.4887},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"4"},{"FaceType":{"_value":4},"statement":{"_text":"\u539f\u6765\u662f\u6211\u53ef\u7231\u7684\u5973\u513f\uff0c\u96c5\u5c14\u6700\u8fd1\u8d8a\u6765\u8d8a\u53ef\u7231\u4e86~","_text_en":"So
    it was my adorable daughter\u2014Yarl is getting cuter and cuter lately~","_text_jp":"\u306a\u3093\u3068\u3001\u6211\u304c\u611b\u3057\u306e\u5a18\u3060\u3063\u305f\u304b\uff01\u30e4\u30fc\u30eb\u306f\u6700\u8fd1\u307e\u3059\u307e\u3059\u53ef\u611b\u304f\u306a\u3063\u305f\u306a\u301c"},"_actorName":"\u738b","_actorParameterID":"38ea5d2c-aaf2-4e22-8e12-25bd6113fad4","_position":{"x":730.2222,"y":483.5949},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"5"},{"FaceType":{"_value":3},"statement":{"_text":"\u55ef\u54fc~","_text_en":"Uh-huh~","_text_jp":"\u3075\u3075\u3093\u301c","_audio":3},"_actorName":"\u96c5\u5c14","_actorParameterID":"49ab5f08-7fb3-49c8-8220-eacfb9100946","_position":{"x":823.2222,"y":569.5949},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"6"},{"FaceType":{"_value":5},"statement":{"_text":"\u554a\uff0c\u90a3\u4e2a\u8be5\u4e0d\u4f1a\u662f\u3002\u3002\u3002\u3002\u5514!\u8fd9\u592a\u8fc7\u5206\u4e86\uff0c\u4f60\u77e5\u9053\u8fd9\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\u5417\u3002","_text_en":"Ah\u2014no
    way...! Ugh! That''s going too far! Do you even realize what this is?","_text_jp":"\u3042\u3063\u3001\u305d\u308c\u306f\u307e\u3055\u304b\u2026\u2026\u3080\u3063\uff01\u3053\u308c\u306f\u3072\u3069\u3059\u304e\u308b\uff01\u3053\u308c\u304c\u4f55\u304b\u5206\u304b\u3063\u3066\u308b\u306e\u304b\uff01"},"_actorName":"\u738b","_actorParameterID":"38ea5d2c-aaf2-4e22-8e12-25bd6113fad4","_position":{"x":675.2222,"y":660.5949},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"7"},{"FaceType":{"_value":6},"statement":{"_text":"\u4e00\u5806\u788e\u5757\u3002","_text_en":"A
    pile of fragments","_text_jp":"\u4e00\u3064\u306e\u5c71\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u7834\u7247\u3002","_audio":4},"_actorName":"\u96c5\u5c14","_actorParameterID":"49ab5f08-7fb3-49c8-8220-eacfb9100946","_position":{"x":812.0,"y":762.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"8"},{"FaceType":{"_value":7},"statement":{"_text":"\u6211\u662f\u8bf4\u521a\u624d\u4ed6\u597d\u7684\u65f6\u5019!","_text_en":"I
    mean when it was intact just now!","_text_jp":"\u3055\u3063\u304d\u307e\u3060\u58ca\u308c\u3066\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u6642\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff01"},"_actorName":"\u738b","_actorParameterID":"38ea5d2c-aaf2-4e22-8e12-25bd6113fad4","_position":{"x":771.0,"y":867.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"9"},{"FaceType":{"_value":6},"statement":{"_text":"\u54ce\u5440~\u574f\u4e86\u5c31\u518d\u4e70\u4e00\u4e2a\u5427\uff0c\u522b\u751f\u6c14\u4e86~","_text_en":"Oops~
    Since it\u2019s broken, just get a new one. Don\u2019t be mad~","_text_jp":"\u307e\u3041\u307e\u3041\u301c\u58ca\u308c\u305f\u3089\u307e\u305f\u8cb7\u3048\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3001\u305d\u3093\u306a\u306b\u6012\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3067\u301c","_audio":5},"_actorName":"\u96c5\u5c14","_actorParameterID":"49ab5f08-7fb3-49c8-8220-eacfb9100946","_position":{"x":739.0,"y":964.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"10"},{"FaceType":{"_value":2},"statement":{"_text":"\u4e70?!\u5356\u4e86\u4f60\u90fd\u6362\u4e0d\u6765\u4e00\u4e2a\u65b0\u7684!","_text_en":"Buy?!
    Even if I sold you, I still couldn\u2019t get a new one!","_text_jp":"\u8cb7\u3046\u3060\u3068\uff1f\uff01\u304a\u524d\u3092\u58f2\u3063\u3066\u3082\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u306e\u306f\u624b\u306b\u5165\u3089\u3093\u305e\uff01"},"_actorName":"\u738b","_actorParameterID":"38ea5d2c-aaf2-4e22-8e12-25bd6113fad4","_position":{"x":817.0,"y":1076.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"11"},{"FaceType":{"_value":8},"statement":{"_text":"\u6211\u8fd9\u4e48\u5ec9\u4ef7\u5417
    !","_text_en":"Am I really that cheap?!","_text_jp":"\u79c1\u3063\u3066\u305d\u3093\u306a\u5b89\u3044\u306e\uff01\uff1f","_audio":6},"_actorName":"\u96c5\u5c14","_actorParameterID":"49ab5f08-7fb3-49c8-8220-eacfb9100946","_position":{"x":856.0,"y":1195.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"12"},{"FaceType":{"_value":2},"statement":{"_text":"\u8fd9\u53ef\u662f\u6211\u4eec\u9f99\u65cf\u7684\u547d\u8109\uff0c\u5b83\u7684\u5b58\u5728\u624d\u8ba9\u6211\u65cf\u5728\u8fd9\u7247\u5927\u9646\u6709\u8fd9\u6837\u7684\u5730\u4f4d!","_text_en":"This
    is the very essence of our dragon race. Its existence is what gives our race
